## Backend port
PORT=5000

## Email provider: Resend (https://resend.com)
## Create an API key in your Resend dashboard.
RESEND_API_KEY=

## Where you want to receive emails (your email)
TO_EMAIL=you@example.com

## A verified sender address in Resend (must be verified in Resend)
FROM_EMAIL="Portfolio <onboarding@resend.dev>"

